      "alt": "Run the gecko comparison.\nmail-client Cloud\n\nThe font-size-dependent list failure had a useful cause: Gecko does not use the page’s font for graphical bullets. It uses a tiny built-in “Mozilla Bullet” font with different ascent/descent metrics, which explains the otherwise odd half-pixel line heights exactly. I’m matching that model directly (the font is SIL OFL), rather than adding another size-specific correction.\n\nCommand execution\n\nFile change\n\nCommand execution\n\n/workspace/mail-client/src/text.rs",
